//
// DFlash's greedy acceptance and streaming unit tests, as a PR gate. They
// import only speculative.py and streaming.py, so they need no NPU, no
// weights and no compile; REQUIRES is empty so they run on every runner.
// Collected by check-programming-examples-llms-host.
//
// RUN: %PYTHON -m unittest discover -s %S/tests -p 'test_*.py' 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: OK
